    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Berlin Maniacs is a top-down 3D story-driven action-adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the role of the young and impressionable Tina in a fictionalized snapshot of West Berlin in 1968, a time when state violence led to radicalization within the student protest movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You decide how to navigate the streets of Berlin - with either discretion or force - and ultimately affect her involvement with a group of protesters that is growing more violent by the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration:</strong> Freely navigate a tiny open world, a city district in the grasp of the political tension between the progressive youth and the police.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dialogue: </strong>Talk to the inhabitants of the city to understand what drives them. Solve quests and discover the political forces of the young West German republic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Equipment: </strong>Fight back with what you can find on the street. Use bottles to distract or attack your enemies, wave a sign during a political protest, and smuggle contraband between factions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100360/extras/7223a6e216c0915881f142015e8a94d4.avif?t=1735908286\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photography: </strong>Utilize Tina's instant film camera to document your journey. Pictures expose police brutality and help you to understand your surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic NPC Behavior: </strong>Utilize and experiment with the NPC's dynamic behavior to hide in crowds, lure the police away or escalate protests into an all-out riot. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100360/extras/afc9c5801a61102e8dc1109ddb3edb4a.avif?t=1735908286\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Berlin Maniacs is a top-down 3D story-driven action-adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the role of the young and impressionable Tina in a fictionalized snapshot of West Berlin in 1968, a time when state violence led to radicalization within the student protest movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You decide how to navigate the streets of Berlin - with either discretion or force - and ultimately affect her involvement with a group of protesters that is growing more violent by the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration:</strong> Freely navigate a tiny open world, a city district in the grasp of the political tension between the progressive youth and the police.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dialogue: </strong>Talk to the inhabitants of the city to understand what drives them. Solve quests and discover the political forces of the young West German republic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Equipment: </strong>Fight back with what you can find on the street. Use bottles to distract or attack your enemies, wave a sign during a political protest, and smuggle contraband between factions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100360/extras/7223a6e216c0915881f142015e8a94d4.avif?t=1735908286\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photography: </strong>Utilize Tina's instant film camera to document your journey. Pictures expose police brutality and help you to understand your surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic NPC Behavior: </strong>Utilize and experiment with the NPC's dynamic behavior to hide in crowds, lure the police away or escalate protests into an all-out riot. </p></li></ul